# Upload only what builds and runs the app. Everything else - tests, docs, notes,
# dev-tool configs, git hooks, GitHub settings and local builds - stays on this
# machine and is never pushed. To upload a new top-level file or folder, add a
# "!/name" line to the allow-list below.

# 1. Ignore everything at the top level...
/*

# 2. ...except these.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/index.html
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vite.config.js
!/server.mjs
!/src/
!/public/
!/scripts/
!/portable/
!/Resources/

# 3. Never upload these, even inside the folders above.
*.md
!/portable/README.md
*.test.*
node_modules/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
~$*
.env
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
